On Day 0, we went through the complete roadmap that will be covered to become a proficient DevOps Engineer.

The technologies and tools included in the roadmap are:

Operating System:** Linux
Programming/Scripting Language:** Shell Scripting
Cloud Platform:** AWS
CI/CD Tools:** Jenkins, GitHub Actions
Containerization:** Docker
Configuration Management Tool:** Ansible
Container Orchestration Tool:** Kubernetes (K8s)
Infrastructure as Code (IaC):** Terraform
Monitoring:** Prometheus, Grafana
Logging:** ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana)

This roadmap provides a structured path to gaining the skills required to become a proficient DevOps Engineer.
